## Notes for the implementer

- **napi camelCase:** `#[napi(js_name = "...")]` is set explicitly so the generated `index.d.ts` matches the wasm `js_name` exactly. After Task 7, eyeball `rs/crates/bindings/paigasus-node-bindings/index.d.ts` (regenerated by `napi build` in Task 9) to confirm the camelCase names.
- **`as_hyphenated()`** is an inherent `uuid::Uuid` method (no trait import, no `uuid` dep needed in the binding crates — the type comes back from the kernel).
- **f64 ms exactness:** all valid 48-bit ms (≤ `2^48 − 1` ≈ year 10889) are < `2^53`, so `Date.now()`/JSON numbers round-trip exactly through `f64`.
- **FFI freshness gotchas** (from prior FFI issues) are already handled by the existing py/ts Moon tasks (the `touch` + `uv sync --reinstall-package` / `napi build` + vitest aliases); no changes needed.

